is shifter can  choose to create a massive explosion  while transforming an explosion that  creates a huge mushroom cloud and  annihilates  a very large area Armin successfully  used this ability to destroy Marley's  entire naval fleet but the user of this  Titan power can also choose to create a  much less powerful splash when  transforming if the circumstances call  for him to be more subtle the colossal  Titan is able to emit massive amounts of  steam from its body and this steam will  burn everything that gets too close to  the Titans body including any potential  enemies it is worth noting that Bertolt  colossal Titan was not able to move  while emitting steam and it had to stop  emitting steam in order to be able to  continue moving the colossal Titan can  continue emitting steam as long as it  has body tissue but eventually if the  steam is released for too long the  entire body will just evaporate then we  have the armored Titans powers as the  name suggests the armored Titan has a  strong armor that covers its body and  for what we've seen so far this Titan  has impressive hand-to-hand combat  skills the armored Titans armor does  restrict its speed but the armored Titan  can ditch certain parts of its armor  such as the armor around its legs in  order to move faster next up we have the  female Titans powers the female Titan is  known for its high endurance and  mobility and this Titan also has the  ability to let out a scream that  attracts pure Titans to its location  although it seems that whenever they are  summoned the pure Titans will try to  devour the female Titan the female Titan  also has the ability to hard in certain  parts of its body which can be very  useful both offensively and defensively  the hardened skin can protect a female  Titan from attacks while also allowing  her to throw stronger more lethal  punches if she does something like  harden her  uncle's Annie's female Titan is also  able to create a crystal cocoon which  can protect the user in case they are  ever captured by the enemy  Annie was able to create this seemingly  indestructible cocoon in order to  prevent the soldiers behind the walls  from interrogating her after her Titan  was defeated by Eren and Mikasa so far  we have seen only one possible way of  breaking through this cocoon and that is  by using the JA Titans jaw to crack the  crystal now let's talk about the Beast  Titan the Beast Titan has the ability to  throw giant objects like boulders for  great distances and he can use this  ability in order to launch devastating  long-range attacks against his enemies  he can throw a single large boulder or a  bunch of smaller boulders and rocks at  the same time which results in massive  widespread damage and is very effective  against a large number of troops that  may be scattered across a wide area the  Beast Titan also has the ability to  harden parts of its body such as the  nape of its neck which is very useful  because the nape is the major weak point  for nearly all Titans  however this hardening process isn't  instant it takes some time and against a  crazy fast opponent like Levi in his  Sonic the Hedgehog mode it is possible  for the opponent to strike the Beast  Titan before the hardening can take  effect the current beast Titan also has  additional abilities but these are the  result of the fact that the current  holder Zeke has royal blood  his royal blood gives him additional  powers that previous beast Titan  shifters did not have such as the  ability to create mindless Titans using  his spinal fluid and control these pure  Titans and get them to do his bidding  interestingly Zeke is able to control  pure Titans even at night as long as  there is moonlight to energize them  because moonlight is of course just  sunlight reflecting off the surface of  the Moon then we have the cart Titan the  cart Titan does not have any special  powers or abilities when it comes to  attacking an opponent but this Titan  does have by far the best endurance and  stamina out of all the Titan shifters  and it is also very fast and  maneuverable because it moves on all  fours the cart Titan is basically the  workhorse of the Titan shifters but the  Marlin military was also able to equip  the car Titan with armor and our  hillarie there by artificially enhancing  its offensive and defensive capabilities  moving on to the jaw tighten the jaw  Titan is known for its impressive speed  and agility because its movements are  similar to that of an ape or monkey this  Titan shifters power is especially well  suited for terrain like forests where it  can grab on to many different objects  like trees which allows it to move  quickly and with great versatility the  jaw Titan also has extremely powerful  claws and of course an extremely  powerful jaw its claws and jaw can break  through even hardened Titan armor and as  we learned during the fight against the  warhammer tighten the jaw Titan can even  crack the hardened crystal cocoons like  the one in which a knee is currently  sealed next up is the Warhammer Titan  this Titan has the unique ability to  create weapons using the same powerful  material that Titans used to harden  their bodies and the Warhammer Titan can  create everything from Spears and spikes  to bows and arrows allowing it to launch  effective short-range and long-range  attacks in addition the Warhammer Titan  is the only Titan who can keep its users  separate from the body of the Titan  during the battle against the Warhammer  Titan in male the Titan user at the time  willy Tiber sister was able to seal  herself inside the same type of crystal  cocoon that Annie is currently sealed in  and as long as this cocoon is connected  to the Titans body through a cable of  flesh the Warhammer Titan can function  this means that the user can protect  himself or herself inside a cocoon while  using the Titan and so trying to attack  the Warhammer Titans nape is completely  useless if the connection between the  cocoon and the user is severed the user  can just create another Titan body  without ever leaving the cocoon which  again is a huge deal because it allows  the user to remain relatively safe while  the battle rages on the outside however  the JA Titans jaw is able to break  through this crystal cocoon and Eren  uses the JA Titans jaw for that very  purpose he forces the jaw Titan to break  through the cocoon against his will and  then proceeds to eat willy Tiber sister  thereby inheriting the Warhammer  it's power and finally we have the  founding Titan the true power of this  Titan can only be harnessed with the use  of royal blood  and for the vast majority of its history  this shifter was passed on through the  different generations of the royal Fritz  family the founding Titan has some  incredibly opie abilities including the  ability to manipulate and erase the  memories of all the subjects of aamir  that is to say all ldiots  the founding Titan can also be used to  transform LD ins into pure and abnormal  Titans like we saw with the giant wall  Titans that were used to form the core  of the three walls on top of creating  Titans the founding time can also  control these Titans and order them to  do his or her bidding this is similar to  Zeke's current abilities due to his own  royal ancestry but we can assume that  the founding Titans ability to create  and control Titans is many levels beyond  anything he can do in addition rumor has  it that the founding Titan is able to  not only manipulate the memories of LD  ends but also their entire biological  composition for instance there are  stories that the founding Titan can make  all LD ins immune to a specific disease  by changing their biological composition  Zeke also believes that this power can  be used to sterilize all ldiots thereby  ensuring the extinction of the entire  nation within just one generation  however it is important to note that  whenever the founding titan power is  inherited by a 